<title>USA: Applied Voice co-founder to retire.</title>
<headline>Applied Voice co-founder to retire.</headline>
<dateline>KIRKLAND, Wash. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Voice Technology Inc on Monday said Dennis King, a co-founder and executive vice president of market development, was retiring.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said King will be retiring as a full time officer and director but will continue his involvement with the company as an industry consultant and advisor.</p>
